cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software (metadata below) and the paper listed under references."
type: software
title: "Interactive 3D Reconstruction"
abstract: >-
  Silhouette-based 3D reconstruction by level-set evolution, with user strokes
  (inside / outside) that steer the result. A Python port of the MATLAB code
  (3d-reconstruction-ui-matlab) behind the paper "An Interactive Control
  Approach to 3D Shape Reconstruction" (ACC 2020). Runs natively or in the
  browser through Pyodide.
authors:
  - family-names: Islam
    given-names: Bipul
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0002-5209-7572"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ibipul/3d-reconstruction-ui"
url: "https://ibipul.github.io/3d-reconstruction-ui/"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
keywords:
  - 3D reconstruction
  - level set
  - shape from silhouettes
  - interactive control
  - human-in-the-loop
